# Failing-first regressions in tests/fm-grok-harness.test.sh (test_grok_worker_home_trims_launch_context: a grok spawn wrote no per-task worker config, left account-managed MCP connectors on, and carried no auth symlink; test_grok_worker_home_resolves_operator_trust_and_policy: the worker home dropped the operator trust store, global instructions, and policy; test_grok_worker_skills_file_keeps_listed_skills: a home could not keep any skill beyond the built-in three; test_grok_worker_unreadable_skills_file_refuses_before_wiring: an unreadable skills file refused a spawn only after its turn-end token was written; test_grok_worker_discovery_failure_warns_and_launches: a failed grok discovery left the worker untrimmed without a warning; test_grok_worker_transcripts_survive_teardown: teardown deleted the worker transcript; test_grok_slim_launch_brief_defers_only_later_sections: a grok launch inlined the full brief and carried no context discipline) and tests/fm-control-relaunch.test.sh (test_grok_worker_skills_refusal_happens_before_the_agent_stops: an unreadable skills file stopped the running agent); the Herdr-lab paired launch measurement is recorded with the PR.
pr: 168
